# Review and label open GitHub issues (`/iflow-review`)

`/iflow-review` helps assess how open issues should be labelled. It is
**extendable by review kind**; v1 supports **`yolo`** only — examine open
issues and add the configured `{{ yolo_label }}` label where the yolo-fitness
judgment says yes.

This is an **off-path** command — `/iflow` never auto-runs it. It does **not**
create new GitHub issues (use `/iflow-issue`, `/iflow-pick fix`, or
`/iflow-epic … publish`) and does **not** remove labels in v1.

